                        route.finality, abi.encodeCall(Finality.artworkFreezeMode, (p.scope)), cap
                    ) != uint256(StreamArtworkFreezeMode.NONE)
        ) revert V.ViewAdoptionFrozen(subject);
        r.source = Documents.load(route, p, authority);
